{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/generation"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"generation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GraphGeneration","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A10GenerationV","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedHypergraph.generation"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/generation"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DirectedHypergraph.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph.swift#L194"},"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"IncidenceMatrixModule"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphPAAE10generationAA0A10GenerationVvp::SYNTHESIZED::s:21IncidenceMatrixModule08OrientedaB0V","role":"symbol","title":"generation","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"generation"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GraphGeneration","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A10GenerationV"}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols"},"references":{"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The oriented incidence matrix of a directed hypergraph: entry (v, p) is −1 when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" is a source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of column "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":", +1 when it is a target, and 0 otherwise. Gallo, Longo, Pallottino and Nguyen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(1993) define a directed hypergraph’s matrix this way (aᵢⱼ = −1 for a tail node, 1 for a head"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"node); a directed graph’s edge is the column with one source and one target, the matrix of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spectral graph theory (B·Bᵀ = L, Godsil–Royle §8.3) and NetworkX’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"incidence_matrix(oriented=True)"},{"type":"text","text":". It conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedHypergraph"},{"type":"text","text":", so the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hypergraphs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithms (B- and F-connection, components, the clique expansion) run on it unchanged; it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DirectedGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix","kind":"symbol","title":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule","title":"IncidenceMatrixModule","role":"collection"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix/generation":{"url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/generation","title":"generation","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/generation","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"generation"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GraphGeneration","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A10GenerationV"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/GraphGeneration":{"url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graphgeneration","title":"GraphGeneration","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphGeneration","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A graph’s generation: which state of which graph it is. Every structural mutation (an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"insertion, a removal, re-pointing an edge) starts a new generation; reserving capacity and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"writing attached map values do not. A structure derived from a graph stores the graph’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"generation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and asks "},{"code":"isCurrent(for:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before it relies on the graph again."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GraphGeneration"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GraphGeneration"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"}}}